---
import Split from './Split.astro';
---
<section id="how" data-tone="light" class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="g" style="row-gap:40px;margin-bottom:clamp(40px,5vw,72px)">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="grid-column:1/4">About me</p>
      <Split as="h2" class="h-section" style="grid-column:4/12" text="I build what I design." />
    </div>
    <div class="principles">
      <div class="principle rv"><h3>On the desk</h3><p>I design tools for traders and analysts. I test early ideas with the people who use them, then build prototypes with product and engineering.</p><a href="/about">About me</a></div>
      <div class="principle rv"><h3>At home</h3><p>I built Winking Star for my two children. Their bedtime routine became a shared board where each star helps a pet grow.</p><a href="/winking-star">Winking Star</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
